  "details": "I am trying to run VRChat in a combination of an HTC Vive headset and Xbox gamepad. Previously, I was able to see a small cursor that would allow me to select options when I'd opened a menu. This cursor is no where to be found and I can't get it to appear during any button presses. I believe this may be a bug introduced after the recent UI update and I was wanting to report it for a potential fix. I want to use my gamepad with my VR headset again while I wait to be able to buy new controllers. Please look into this issue, thank you.",
